{"id":"51d96e53efebc2d6","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ac0.md","title":"df-ac0 (AC⁰ Complexity Class)","display":"df-ac0 (AC⁰ Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]","[[28-df-circuit-depth]]"],"display":"df-ac0 (AC⁰ Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-ac0","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-ac0","AC0","AC⁰ Complexity Class"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.25","source_printed_pages":"118","source_pdf_pages":"144","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" href=\"?note=f62ab4c80ccedf7e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-depth\">28-df-circuit-depth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ac0 (AC⁰ Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ac0"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ac0</span><span>AC0</span><span>AC⁰ Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.25"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"118"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"144"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\)</span> is the class of one-output Boolean-circuit families</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}\\)</span> are circuit measures</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{AC}^0\">\\(\\mathbf{AC}^0\\)</span> 为下式定义的语言类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{AC}^0\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\bigm|\\;\n&amp;\\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\n\\exists a,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le(n+1)^a\n\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le d\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\n(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{AC}^0\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\bigm|\\;\n&amp;\\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\n\\exists a,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le(n+1)^a\n\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le d\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\n(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>非一致电路族；AND/OR 可有无界扇入。P/poly 的多项式规模可转换为有界扇入模型，而 AC⁰ 的常深度要求保留无界扇入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.25，印刷页 118；PDF 页 144。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-depth","status":"resolved","id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-depth]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{AC}^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{AC}^0\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\bigm|\\;\n&\\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\n\\exists a,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le(n+1)^a\n\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le d\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\n(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一致性与电路类：[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]、[[28-df-nc]]、[[28-df-nc1]]、[[28-df-ac0]]、[[28-df-tc0]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。"},{"id":"3bf0fbe848a49bdc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600","f62ab4c80ccedf7e"]}